/// CurationLevel — уровень triage'а для CurationItem (см. plans/tz/2026-05-21-sba-alpha-4-layer4-curation-foundation.md §4).
/// `light` — одна кнопка approve/reject; `deep` — полный provenance + reasoning.
enum CurationLevel {
